ent-PlushieScp999 = Plushie "SCP-999"
    .desc = A soft orange plush toy shaped like a slightly melted blob of jelly, radiating a warm, calming glow. When touched, it emits a barely audible contented chirp, as if it is happy to be hugged.
    .suffix = SCP-999
ent-PlushieClassD = Class-D plushie
    .desc = This plushie is dressed in a miniature orange robe. Despite its cute face, there is an awareness in its button eyes that the next job may be its last.
